                                "sense_id": "b1028dab-d4da-3457-8e5f-485fe7e02d07",
                                "text": "Het restaurant biedt een uitgelezen menu met culinaire hoogstandjes.",
                                "translation": "The restaurant offers a carefully selected menu with culinary delights.",
                                "english": "The restaurant offers a carefully selected menu with culinary delights."
                            },
                            {
